            "review_title": "Review at Co Nhi",
            "review_text": "CoHo\nFountain Valley, California14 contributions\n0\nA Surprised Find\nJun 2025 • Couples\nWe were looking for Mi Quang Co Thuy, but when we got there around 7:30 PM, it was closed. Co Nhi shop was two doors down and filled with locals, so we came in and I got the last bowl of Mi Quang special for the day. It was the bomb! The broth was very tasty. No wonder it got the 4.8 rating on Google Maps. I am so surprised that it is not listed on TripAdvisor, given that it is within walking distance from many hotels around the area. By the way, there is no AC in the shop. It is in an alley off the main street so it is more like a local favorite rather than a tourist trap.\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2025",
